  "description": "Proposed two storey side extension on footprint of existing garage, hip to gable conversion and loft conversion.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed first floor side extension, in\r\nconjunction with the proposed gable end and rear dormer, would result in a discordant and\r\nungainly cumulative addition to the dwelling and would fail to meet the high\r\nquality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024).\r\nThe proposal is also contrary to Policy D3.D (1) and (11) of the London Plan\r\n(2021), Core Strategy Policy CSB (2012), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development\r\nManagement Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Harrow Supplementary\r\nPlanning Document Residential Design Guide (2010) and GR1 of the Draft Harrow\r\nLocal Plan 2021-2041.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
